{"2846930": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Starlit Stories", "steam_appid": 2846930, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Starlit Stories. Relax to calming music as you build and customize your dream campsite. Watch as travelers come and go, adding life to your tranquil retreat. There's no management or deadlines for you to meet. Just wind down and let your creativity flow in this cozy campsite builder. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846930/extras/4ebdaa58a79f0f7f741369384b8e4b7e.avif?t=1762282179\" alt=\"build your campsite\" width=1024 height=250 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846930/extras/7a9ca4ff1f34659684a1caf83a5e2e45.avif?t=1762282179\" alt=\"\"width=1024 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846930/extras/cda517fc6a9c3baaa077a72d0ffad861.poster.avif?t=1762282179\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846930/extras/cda517fc6a9c3baaa077a72d0ffad861.webm?t=1762282179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846930/extras/cda517fc6a9c3baaa077a72d0ffad861.mp4?t=1762282179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846930/extras/b4b278d162da06ee3b983072d456acee.avif?t=1762282179\" alt=\"\"width=1024 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Build your campsite just the way you like it! Place tents, campfires, and decorations wherever you want, and create a cozy retreat that’s uniquely yours. Enjoy total freedom and let your creativity shine—no limits, no pressure, just your dream campsite coming to life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846930/extras/5364ce597614bc7cdeb4d906b6a0b849.avif?t=1762282179\" width=1024 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> As travelers visit your campsite, you’ll earn XP and level up—unlocking new buildings and upgrades. Collect entry fees from your visitors and use them to expand and customize your dream retreat. Grow your campsite, discover fresh ways to play, and make every visit even more rewarding!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846930/extras/8084cf253651a5dbf3e2e64f37bbaf8f.avif?t=1762282179\" width=1024 height=250 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846930/extras/7a9ca4ff1f34659684a1caf83a5e2e45.avif?t=1762282179\" alt=\"\"width=1024 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846930/extras/619303a9fb225f161fc4f202b0af825f.poster.avif?t=1762282179\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846930/extras/619303a9fb225f161fc4f202b0af825f.webm?t=1762282179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846930/extras/619303a9fb225f161fc4f202b0af825f.mp4?t=1762282179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846930/extras/b4b278d162da06ee3b983072d456acee.avif?t=1762282179\" alt=\"\"width=1024 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Step into first person mode at any time and explore your campsite up close! Walk around, admire your creations from the ground level, and experience your cozy retreat just like your travelers do. It’s your world—see it from a whole new perspective!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846930/extras/d505e7a7ad8df1e266c4ab0ea9270871.avif?t=1762282179\" width=1024 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846930/extras/7a9ca4ff1f34659684a1caf83a5e2e45.avif?t=1762282179\" alt=\"\"width=1024 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846930/extras/389bd18ed3325539ca537dd3ddcf4c1f.poster.avif?t=1762282179\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846930/extras/389bd18ed3325539ca537dd3ddcf4c1f.webm?t=1762282179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846930/extras/389bd18ed3325539ca537dd3ddcf4c1f.mp4?t=1762282179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846930/extras/6d3e02cb5b6ac5622f48e368ae7f6dee.avif?t=1762282179\" width=1024 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Customize every moment in your campsite—set the day and night cycle exactly how you want, and shape the weather to match your mood. Whether you prefer sunny days, starry nights, or gentle rain, you control the atmosphere and bring your dream retreat to life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your dream capsite</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your campsite</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to relaxing music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch the travelers inhabit your campsite</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Starlit Stories. Relax to calming music as you build and customize your dream campsite. Watch as travelers come and go, adding life to your tranquil retreat. There's no management or deadlines for you to meet. Just wind down and let your creativity flow in this cozy campsite builder. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846930/extras/4ebdaa58a79f0f7f741369384b8e4b7e.avif?t=1762282179\" alt=\"build your campsite\" width=1024 height=250 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846930/extras/7a9ca4ff1f34659684a1caf83a5e2e45.avif?t=1762282179\" alt=\"\"width=1024 height=100 /></span></p><p c